Subject: [PATCH] wire: demo students go through the onboarding pipeline, with
 a fixture fallback
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The seed hands each demo student's generated listening data to
onboarding's analyzeFixture, so they get a Claude summary from the fixed
labels and a Voyage vector like real students (§6.7), and onboarding
confirms them when the summary is done. If Claude can't finish within two
minutes (for example while the key is missing), the fixture's summary
stands in, so demo fill never waits on it. Tests cover both paths.

